Recommends: softhsm2
Description: Binary integrity wrapper for CC FPT_TST.1 compliance
 siros-integrity-guard verifies an HSM-signed manifest of file digests
 before exec'ing a protected service binary. It implements the FPT_TST.1
 self-test requirement from Common Criteria (NOBCCS protection profile).
 .
 Features:
  - PKCS#11/HSM-based HMAC-SHA256 manifest signature verification
  - fs-verity kernel measurement with SHA-256 fallback
  - Debugger attachment detection via /proc/self/status
  - Static musl binary (~1-2 MB) suitable for minimal containers
  - Zero-overhead: exec's the target binary after verification
